{"id": "DezJsUWuQqo", "title": "Video by beakman.studios", "description": "3 unconventional tricks we use to optimise our game! We\u2019re both big steamdeck players, and we want our game to run on as many devices as possible so optimisation has been a big point as we work on our upcoming roguelike - Barrow and Blade. Besides your typical techniques like occlusion culling, baked lighting, and object pooling, we\u2019re using a few techniques that are a bit more novel so we thought we\u2019d make a video giving a brief overview of them! All 3 of these techniques have the added benefit of helping us achieve the art style we\u2019ve envisioned for the game, despite only being a team of two. \n\nIf you want to hear more about Barrow and Blade, our upcoming game that combines hack and slash roguelike dungeon crawling with a tactical shopkeeping deckbuilder, we\u2019d love if you\u2019d drop us a follow and join the discord in our bio! \n\n#roguelike #indiedev #gamedev #gamedevtips", "channel": "beakman.studios", "uploader_id": "65706071197", "uploader": "Beakman Studios", "timestamp": 1792677846, "like_count": 3313, "comment_count": 75, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1439640422555606a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 62.856, "asr": 44100, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOxKtMz_5HrO871gjXVw1G0N6mQ3OonFQP8XGvqrNc3Bzh0Pa0RBH1_ISArG9pMMwhpSHYPohUvQRA2Y8ho2FSPSufOtnR4GI-SG24.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_