LZE6JFRsSpea8DvlhI2zp_y5Mb73cozIzKPf8&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=xJlOcS3npmnu1SoSYPY1BA&_nc_ss=79689&oh=00_AQRlL_kjTJu61AXpVt_csSTXqIkX2Wx6rDIePfjCxasdXw&oe=6AE89DEF", "width": 720, "height": 1280, "id": "11", "resolution": "720x1280"}], "comments": [{"author": "fuppedspellngstudios", "author_id": "16527971566", "id": "18133663552666580", "text": "Big fan of optimisation. It\u2019s such a critical but forgotten art, especially when it looks as good as this!", "timestamp": 1793050238, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "_samet__can", "author_id": "325666779", "id": "18097634234654338", "text": "Storing time inside a texture. I see what you did there... Looking cool ^^", "timestamp": 1792963679, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "emi6aston", "author_id": "3419480477", "id": "18103775438375388", "text": "Can i borrow some of the techniques?", "timestamp": 1792853609, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "quadchroma.tech", "author_id": "55238210621", "id": "18152945374491658", "text": "@beakman.studios ha fair enough, a deck that lives on the charger is very relatable \ud83d\ude04 love that you're building it with deck players in mind, rooting for you both", "timestamp": 1792806135, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "quadchroma.tech", "author_id": "55238210621", "id": "18115588328039382", "text": "good call testing on a steam deck, handheld hardware is a proper reality check. i would be curious whether the baked lighting also helps battery life there", "timestamp": 1792800380, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "ufosandgames", "author_id": "45449093496", "id": "18428305399147458", "text": "Your game looks awesome! But heads-up, I can\u2019t NOT think of Skeletor when I see your main character running around. If that\u2019s not a connotation you want, you might want to adjust the color scheme on their cloak?", "timestamp": 1792790965, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "zimt_games", "author_id": "32661800551", "id": "17913663540555463", "text": "This is so interesting. I still have a lot to learn in that area, I love videos like this", "timestamp": 1792766182, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "bushcor", "author_id": "905245671", "id": "18149375653521128", "text": "I looked for them on Steam, but they don't appear...", "timestamp": 1792758577, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "_inlagenam", "author_id": "2158929630", "id": "17908471605329354", "text": "Looking neat ! How do you deal with the shadow casting against object, walls etc?", "timestamp": 1792757857, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "campaign.dev", "author_id": "75605754795", "id": "17891656404459037", "text": "So smart. So cool \ud83d\udc4f", "timestamp": 1792739788, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "bananabraingames", "author_id": "42487775460", "id": "18345753991283790", "text": "The environments look amazing! \ud83d\udd25  been wondering how to accomplish that hand drawn effect in 3D. Thanks for sharing", "timestamp": 1792736007, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "deadeyesn", "author_id": "2278508078", "id": "17925905025426089", "text": "I'm interested in the artstyle, what's it name?", "timestamp": 1792724661, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "insanehurr1c4ne_", "author_id": "38237367253", "id": "17926015977429229", "text": "If thus projection method would work on a 3rd person Mario kart type camera angle, my director would be really happy? We discussed projection but around the entire mesh rather than just an isometric angle lock.", "timestamp": 1792716977, "like_count": 5}, {"author": "insanehurr1c4ne_", "author_id": "38237367253", "id": "18005842997792968", "text": "That time texture trick is very cool. \ud83d\ude2e", "timestamp": 1792716808, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "pleroma_studios", "author_id": "67742849550", "id": "18128953867764948", "text": "Nice presentation from a fellow indie dev \ud83d\udc4f", "timestamp": 1792712928, "like_count": 1}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DezJsUWuQqo/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DezJsUWuQqo/", "webpage_url_basename"